{"id":57920,"date":"2026-08-08T15:20:57","date_gmt":"2026-08-08T14:20:57","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-10-28T08:03:40","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T07:03:40","slug":"maratona-de-genebra","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-genebra\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de Genebra 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de Genebra 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Maratona de Genebra 2027<\/strong> (21\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do <em>Generali Gen\u00e8ve Marathon<\/em>) realiza-se no fim de semana de <strong>8 e 9 de maio de 2027<\/strong>, com as provas principais de domingo, <strong>9 de maio de 2027<\/strong>, a partirem \u00e0s <strong>07h45<\/strong> (Meia Maratona) e \u00e0s <strong>09h00<\/strong> (Maratona e Estafetas) em <strong>Chemin Frank-Thomas, Cologny<\/strong>, rumo \u00e0 emblem\u00e1tica meta na <strong>Pont du Mont-Blanc, em Genebra, Su\u00ed\u00e7a<\/strong>. Organizado pela <strong>Association Gen\u00e8ve Marathon<\/strong> (filiada na <em>Swiss Athletics<\/em>) e pela <strong>OC Sport Outdoor Suisse S\u00e0rl<\/strong>, o evento det\u00e9m o selo <em>World Athletics Label<\/em> e o estatuto inclusivo <em>Unified by Swiss Inclusive Sport<\/em>, acolhendo em 2027 os <strong>Campeonatos Su\u00ed\u00e7os de Maratona<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Reconhecido como um dos percursos mais r\u00e1pidos da Su\u00ed\u00e7a e mais panor\u00e2micos da Europa, o tra\u00e7ado de volta \u00fanica combina as estradas campestres e vinhas do cant\u00e3o de Genebra, com vista para os cumes alpinos do Monte Branco, e as margens do <strong>Lago L\u00e9man<\/strong> em frente ao famoso <strong>Jet d'Eau<\/strong>. Nos termos do regulamento oficial de 2027, o programa completo compreende oito formatos: no s\u00e1bado, 8 de maio, realizam-se as <strong>Courses Juniors<\/strong> (500 m a 2,5 km para crian\u00e7as dos 3 aos 13 anos a partir das 15h30), os <strong>5 km by Always<\/strong> (18h00, limite de 50 minutos) e os <strong>10 km Corrida, Walking e Nordic Walking<\/strong> (19h00, limite de 2h00, chegada no Quai Gustave-Ador); no domingo, 9 de maio, disputam-se a <strong>Meia Maratona e Semi Fauteuil<\/strong> (21,0975 km \u00e0s 07h45, limite de 3h00, idade m\u00ednima 17 anos), a <strong>Maratona<\/strong> (42,195 km \u00e0s 09h00, limite de <strong>6h00<\/strong> com barreiras hor\u00e1rias de 3h10 ao km 22 e 4h35 ao km 32, idade m\u00ednima 18 anos) e o <strong>Marathon Relais by Core Lean<\/strong> (equipas de 4 a 6 atletas a partir dos 14 anos). Consulta tamb\u00e9m o guia completo das principais <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Maratonas em Portugal<\/a> e planeia o teu ritmo na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">9 de Maio de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Chemin Frank-Thomas, Cologny (Partida) e Pont du Mont-Blanc (Chegada), Genebra, Su\u00ed\u00e7a<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">42,2 km, 21,1 km, Estafetas (4 a 6), 10 km, 5 km e Corridas J\u00fanior<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Association Gen\u00e8ve Marathon & OC Sport Outdoor Suisse S\u00e0rl<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">6h00 (42 km) | 3h00 (21 km) | 2h00 (10 km)<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"displa